      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 19,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nOh, hello~ you are one energetic adventurer.\nWelcome to ^8B4513Hugel^000000. I am honored to guide you in this beautiful village.\nIf this is the first time for you to use the guide services, you should ask a lot of questions.",
      "translation" : "[毀葛嚮導婆婆]\n哎呀，你好呀~ 你真是精力充沛的冒險者呢。\n歡迎來到^8B4513毀葛^000000。我很榮幸能在這美麗的村莊為您引路。\n如果您是第一次使用嚮導服務，不妨多問一些問題。"
    },
