      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nI will mark the location\nof the ^DA70D6Cool Event Corp. Staff^000000\non your mini-map.\n{0}",
      "translation" : "[毀葛嚮導婆婆]\n我會在您的小地圖上\n標記^DA70D6酷活動公司職員^000000的位置。\n{0}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nI'll remove the marks from your mini-map.\nIs there anything else I can do for you?",
      "translation" : "[毀葛嚮導婆婆]\n我會移除您小地圖上的標記。\n還有什麼我可以幫您的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nHo ho ho ~!\nGuiding is very interesting.",
      "translation" : "[毀葛嚮導婆婆]\n呵呵呵~！\n做嚮導真是件有趣的事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Guide Rich King",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Rich King]\nWhat business do you have\nin this countryside village?",
      "translation" : "[富有的國王]\n你來這個鄉間小村\n有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Guide Rich King",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Rich King]\nThis is ^8B4513Hugel^000000\nin the Schwarzwald Republic.\nYou are very honored to receive guidance from a great person like me.",
      "translation" : "[富有的國王]\n這裡是修瓦魯茲巴魯德共和國的^8B4513毀葛^000000。\n能得到像我這樣偉大人物的指引，真是你的榮幸。"
